      "question": "Which figure should replace the question mark (?) if the following series were to be continued?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which figure should replace the question mark (?) if the following series were to be continued?</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D98nn.png\" style=\"width: 396px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
