        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D102.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 81px;\" />"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">1) First box series →</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">All the elements shift clockwise.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Center element is replaced by new element subsequently.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2) Second box series →</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2nd column elements shift to the 3rd column.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2nd and 3rd element of third column shift to the 2nd column diagonally.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Rest of the elements interchange positions.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D105.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 396px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D98nn.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D99.png",
