    {
      "id": "33173d895637-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "How many triangles are there in the given figure?",
      "questionHtml": "How many triangles are there in the given figure?<br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D107.png\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 109px;\" />",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "6",
          "html": "6"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "8",
          "html": "8"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "4",
          "html": "4"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "5",
          "html": "5"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">1) Total triangles = Number of parts × Number of diagonals</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 2 × 1 ⇒ 2</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D108.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 413px; height: 109px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">2) Total triangles = [Number of parts × (1 + Number of parts)] ÷ 2</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= [2 × (1 + 2)] ÷ 2</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= [2 × 3] ÷ 2</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 6 ÷ 2</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">= 3</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravSS_SSC_2_12_24_D1088.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">3) As marked there are a total of 3 triangles.</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D109.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 202px; height: 148px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Thus, there are total (2 + 3 + 3) = 8 triangles.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D107.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D108.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravSS_SSC_2_12_24_D1088.png",
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D109.png"
      ],
      "subject": null,
