      "id": "33173d895637-q12",
      "number": 12,
      "question": "Three of the following numbers are alike in a certain way and one is different. Pick the odd one out. (NOTE: Operations should be performed on the whole numbers, without breaking down the numbers into its constituent digits. E.g. 13 &ndash; Operations on 13 such as adding/deleting/multiplying etc., to 13 can be performed. Breaking down 13 into 1 and 3 and then performing mathematical operations on 1 and 3 is not allowed.)",
      "questionHtml": "Three of the following numbers are alike in a certain way and one is different. Pick the odd one out.<br />\n(NOTE: Operations should be performed on the whole numbers, without breaking down the numbers into its constituent digits.<br />\nE.g. 13 &ndash; Operations on 13 such as adding/deleting/multiplying etc., to 13 can be performed. Breaking down 13 into 1 and 3 and then performing mathematical operations on 1 and 3 is not allowed.)",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "36 &ndash; 84",
          "html": "36 &ndash; 84"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "72 &ndash; 168",
          "html": "72 &ndash; 168"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "66 &ndash; 154",
          "html": "66 &ndash; 154"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "33 &ndash; 72",
          "html": "33 &ndash; 72"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Option 4) 33 – 72</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">33 × 7 ÷ 3 = 72</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><u><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">231 ÷ 3</span></u> = 72</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">77 ≠ 72<span style=\"font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\"> </span>(LHS ≠ RHS)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, out of all the options, '33 – 72<span style=\"font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">' is the odd one out.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
