      "id": "33173d895637-q17",
      "number": 17,
      "question": "Select the set in which the numbers are related in the same way as are the numbers of the following sets. (34, 47, 62) (119, 142, 167) (NOTE: Operations should be performed on the whole numbers, without breaking down the numbers into its constituent digits. E.g. 13 &ndash; Operations on 13 such as adding/deleting/multiplying etc. to 13 can be performed. Breaking down 13 into 1 and 3 and performing mathematical operations on 1 and 3 is not allowed)",
      "questionHtml": "Select the set in which the numbers are related in the same way as are the numbers of the following sets.<br />\n(34, 47, 62)<br />\n(119, 142, 167)<br />\n(NOTE: Operations should be performed on the whole numbers, without breaking down the numbers into its constituent digits. E.g. 13 &ndash; Operations on 13 such as adding/deleting/multiplying etc. to 13 can be performed. Breaking down 13 into 1 and 3 and performing mathematical operations on 1 and 3 is not allowed)",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "(27, 37, 51)",
          "html": "(27, 37, 51)"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "(48, 65, 82)",
          "html": "(48, 65, 82)"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "(64, 78, 99)",
          "html": "(64, 78, 99)"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "(79, 98, 119)",
          "html": "(79, 98, 119)"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Option 4) (79, 98, 119)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">79 + 2 = 81 ⇒ Perfect square of 9</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">98 + 2 = 100 ⇒ Perfect square of 10</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">119 + 2 = 121 ⇒ Perfect square of 11</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, out of all the options, '(79, 98, 119)<span style=\"font-weight: var(--bs-body-font-weight); text-align: var(--bs-body-text-align);\">' follows the same logic as given.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
