    {
      "id": "33173d895637-q22",
      "number": 22,
      "question": "In a certain code language, A + B means &lsquo;A is the son of B&rsquo;, A &minus; B means &lsquo;A is the sister of B&rsquo;, A &times; B means &lsquo;A is the brother of B&rsquo; and A &divide; B means &lsquo;A is the mother of B&rsquo;. Based on the above, how is T related to P if &lsquo;P &divide; Q &times; R &minus; M + T&rsquo;?",
      "questionHtml": "In a certain code language,<br />\nA + B means &lsquo;A is the son of B&rsquo;,<br />\nA &minus; B means &lsquo;A is the sister of B&rsquo;,<br />\nA &times; B means &lsquo;A is the brother of B&rsquo; and<br />\nA &divide; B means &lsquo;A is the mother of B&rsquo;.<br />\nBased on the above, how is T related to P if &lsquo;P &divide; Q &times; R &minus; M + T&rsquo;?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Son",
          "html": "Son"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Brother",
          "html": "Brother"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Father",
          "html": "Father"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Husband",
          "html": "Husband"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-weight: bolder;\">Given: </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">P ÷ Q × R − M + T</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/24/12/F1_SouravS_SSC_2_12_24_D126.png\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41); width: 134px; height: 102px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, T is P's husband.</p>\n",
